  "description": "After his shaman grandfather passes away, Yoon Dam suddenly gains the ability to see ghosts—a gift he would rather not have. The only solution? The power of a goblin. Enter Lee Do-Han, who claims to be exactly that. But there’s a catch: every time Do-Han tries to harm Yoon Dam, mysterious wounds appear on his own body instead. Intrigued by this bizarre connection, Do-Han proposes a deal: “Why not just let me be your tutor?” Bound by strange circumstances and their own hidden agendas, the two set off on a journey neither of them could have imagined…\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
